5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure we make a wise choice, I would like to look into the closeout files of finished awards and the portfolio review of schedule overruns.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I agree that a cautious approach is best. I will look into the staffing rolls for technical posts and the minutes on secondments and crew strength to assess the available human resources.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we must consider the infrastructure supporting these projects. I will look into the accreditation and bookings at shared facilities and the incident logs on shared instrumentation.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It seems we are all quite thorough today. To complement your efforts, I shall examine the travel and bench-fee lines in the ledgers and the national computing agreement and facility day rates.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I think it's important to understand where projects might face unexpected delays. I'll look into the station records from partner field sites and the national repository deposit turnaround.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,It seems we have covered a great deal of ground already. I am content with our selections and happy to wait for the results.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. We have a comprehensive set of data points. I will wait for the findings to be presented.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I agree. There is no need to overlap our efforts when we have already distributed the tasks so logically. I shall wait for the reports.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the division of labor is quite efficient. I shall leave us to our reflections until the data arrives.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
